    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18770" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχρει-όω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχρει-χρεόω</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			<u>OGI</u>
			573.16
		</span></i>), pf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠχρείωκα</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>render useless, disable, damage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dicaearch.
				2.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.64.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Da.</u>
				4.11
			</span></i>, <u>OGI</u> l.c.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχρεῶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					569.31
				</span></i>
			 (Crete, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.14.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				35.286
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); <i>to be corrupted,</i>
