				LXX
				<u>Ps.</u>
				13(14).3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ ἀπειρίαν ἠχρειώθησαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollon.Cit.
					1.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
